{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/800884-1ed-where-can-i-find-the-merit-status-kindred-legend","id":800884,"title":"[1ed] Where Can I Find the Merit \"Status (Kindred Legend)\"?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-04T19:47:53-08:00","id":800884,"title":"[1ed] Where Can I Find the Merit \"Status (Kindred Legend)\"?","content":"In both of the Unholy's write-ups she has five dots in Status (Kindred Legend), but I can't find the merit in any of the books that I've checked. Can anyone give me a page reference for it?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8153-almondsandrain","name":"almondsAndRain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-04T20:03:30-08:00","id":800893,"title":"","content":"It's just the Status Merit. (Kindred Legend) is what she has Status in, the same way you can have Status (Police) or Status (Invictus) or what have you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-04T20:40:03-08:00","id":800953,"title":"","content":"Oh, I had assumed that it had some unique effects, because \u201cKindred Legend\u201d isn't really an organization you can join. I guess she benefits from the merit when dealing with most other kindred then, sort of like Status (Kindred Vampire)?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8153-almondsandrain","name":"almondsAndRain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-04T20:45:47-08:00","id":800958,"title":"","content":"Yeah, it's kind of a weird thing to have Status in, I would have thought Fame would express the same idea better. But <i>c'est la vie</i>, I guess. I'd probably have it apply to anyone familiar with her legend.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-04T21:03:43-08:00","id":800970,"title":"","content":"I think the idea is that it functions more like Domain Status than Covenant or mortal Status, except it's so crazy high that it can function across domain, based on people who respect or fear her legend.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-04T21:45:38-08:00","id":800993,"title":"","content":"My guess is that they didn't use Fame because she's not famous in mortal circles, which Fame applies. Kindred Legend isn't an official status or group, but rather the best way to represent the level of respect and/or fear and/or deference afforded to her - she may not command an entire Covenant, but other Kindred are probably going to defer to her to avoid being killed, and everyone but the freshest neonates know her story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1407-endlesskng","name":"EndlessKng","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T04:56:45-08:00","id":801281,"title":"","content":"Also, it can go above 3 dots.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}